{"id":"vod_jy_92124","vodId":"92124","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"火影忍者外传：李洛克的青春FULL POWER忍传","name_cn":"火影忍者外传：李洛克的青春FULL POWER忍传","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第51集完结","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/35654af367f125d3798f1b60e1e7ac91.jpg"},"summary":"顾名思义，《李洛克的青春 FULL POWER 忍传》是以《火影忍者》中的登场人物李洛克为主人公的派生漫画。熟悉《火影忍者》的粉丝都知道，李洛克是以国际功夫巨星李小龙(微博)为原型创作的人物，他既单纯又热血，一心想要成为一个优秀的忍者。但可惜的是，他身上既没有被笼罩上无敌的主角光环，也没有得天独厚的强大的忍术资质，幻术和忍术基本不会。但即使如此他也没有放弃梦想，反而用比别人多上几十倍的努力，刻苦修炼体术，经历一次次失败也不气馁，最终实现了理想，成为了一名优秀的忍者，被阿凯老师称赞为“努力的天才”。小李本身","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-12-11 14:10:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":51,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/ejRQ3DRe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/epYw3M2a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/aOYlwmgd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/aQWJyQqd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/aKrXpwne/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dG6nlByb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/ejRQ3z5e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/b68oE39e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/aQWJyDYd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/aADqV0ze/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bDkNg3na/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dwp93Jwe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/elYQ3JJa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/ejRQ3zWe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/b828JRoe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/erkZ3z6a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.co